          "text": "Description: On January 3, 2010, a witness observed from his garden three round lights just above him. No noise was heard. They disappeared instantly. The characteristics described in the observation (three round lights at low altitude moving together...then 'disappearing' due to fuel depletion) and the strong presumption from the initial elements of the gendarmerie investigation, correspond to the probable observation of flying lanterns.",
